  "name": "Chorizo-Stuffed Bell Peppers",
  "subtitle": "Tender peppers filled with savory sausage, rice, vegetables, and melted cheese.",
  "description": "Blanch bell peppers, fill them with a chorizo, rice, vegetable, and tomato mixture, then bake with a three-cheese topping until tender and safely cooked.",
